                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The procedure for processing a grievance, except a grievance pertaining to matters general in nature or concerning a layoff, discharge or upgrade shall be as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                108,
                126,
                730,
                201
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    108.0,
                    126.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    126.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    201.0
                ],
                [
                    108.0,
                    201.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step One: When an employee has a complaint or problem that is an alleged violation of this Agreement, he/she or the Department Steward, if requested by the employee, shall, within five (5) working days following the event or events on which the complaint or problem is based, notify his or her immediate Supervisor that they are requesting a First Step meeting. The employee's immediate Supervisor will then schedule a meeting within an additional five (5) working days, which will be attended by the employee and his Department Steward or Senior Steward, if requested by the employee, and either the Supervisor or the Superintendent/Section Head. The Supervisor or the Superintendent/Section Head, the employee and the Department Steward or Senior Steward are fully authorized to make every effort to resolve the complaint within the provisions of this Agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                215,
                730,
                510
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    215.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    215.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    510.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    510.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Grievances settled under Step One of this procedure are not precedent setting and are without prejudice to matters involving any other grievance and cannot contravene the language of the contract. If the parties are unable to resolve the issue, a record that the meeting was held will be signed by those in attendance and made a part of the Second Step record.",
            "block_bbox": [
                141,
                523,
                730,
                653
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    141.0,
                    523.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    523.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    653.0
                ],
                [
                    141.0,
                    653.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step Two: If the matter is not resolved in Step One it may be reduced to writing, signed by the aggrieved employee and his/her Department Steward and filed with the cognizant Labor Relations office within fourteen (14) working days following the event or events on which the grievance is based. The written grievance shall conform to Section D.2. of this Article. Within five (5) working days after the Company's receipt of the written grievance a Step Two grievance meeting shall be held to review the facts of the grievance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                141,
                667,
                731,
                852
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    141.0,
                    667.0
                ],
                [
                    731.0,
                    667.0
                ],
                [
                    731.0,
                    852.0
                ],
                [
                    141.0,
                    852.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Step Two grievance meeting will consist of the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                142,
                865,
                729,
                905
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    142.0,
                    865.0
                ],
                [
                    729.0,
                    865.0
                ],
                [
                    729.0,
                    905.0
                ],
                [
                    142.0,
                    905.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For the Company: The Department Manager and a Labor Relations representative. In case of emergencies, the Department Manager will designate an individual with appropriate authority to settle the grievance. The designated individual will not be the same individual assigned to a previous step of the specific grievance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                141,
                920,
                730,
                1032
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    141.0,
                    920.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    920.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    1032.0
                ],
                [
                    141.0,
                    1032.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For the Union: A Union Business Representative and the Senior Steward certified for the Division where the grievance occurred.",
